/**
 * The Nationwide Logistics tender U6683409 as the pdfjs text layer emits it,
 * page by page.
 *
 * This is the CLEAN-LAYER half of the ingest/manual verbatim equivalence pin.
 * Blue Grace covers the damaged-layer case, where the model's transcription wins;
 * this document covers the clean case, where the printed page wins. An ingest
 * extractor that silently returns nothing would pass the Blue Grace half and fail
 * here, which is exactly the failure this fixture exists to name.
 *
 * Extracted with the same pdfjs 5.7.284 pipeline both paths use, from the
 * original 3-page PDF, joined the same way (`item.str` + EOL, items joined with
 * a space, pages joined with a newline). DO NOT HAND-EDIT a character to make a
 * test pass — re-extract from the document.
 */

